fund-csharp/02-nullable-reference-types/.explanation:
The `??` chain only falls through on null. A nickname of `"   "` is not null, so it is trimmed to `""` and returned, and the blank-nickname test gets an empty name instead of the full name. Test each candidate with `string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace` and fall through when it is blank:

```csharp
if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(c?.Nickname)) return c.Nickname.Trim();
if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(c?.FullName)) return c.FullName.Trim();
return "Guest";
```
